# Both Shifts and Esc for 3 s release every grab and every held key. AC-17.
0 in key KEY_LEFTSHIFT down
0 out key KEY_LEFTSHIFT down
100 in key KEY_RIGHTSHIFT down
100 out key KEY_RIGHTSHIFT down
200 in key KEY_ESC down
200 out key KEY_CAPSLOCK down
4000 in key KEY_ESC up
3200 out key KEY_LEFTSHIFT up
3200 out key KEY_RIGHTSHIFT up
3200 out key KEY_CAPSLOCK up
3200 out grab release
